    "facebook_testimonials_r6Afm8": {
      "type": "facebook-testimonials",
      "blocks": {
        "column_WYqrYL": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "post_author": "Richard M.",
            "post_author_avatar": "shopify://shop_images/t_i_xu_ng_3.png",
            "post_author_verified": false,
            "post_time": "2h ago",
            "post_text": "<p>I’m 66 and I’ve been driving for over 40 years, so I always thought I knew my limit. Two glasses of wine at dinner never felt like something I needed to worry about. The first weekend I used <strong>HOSFU</strong>, it showed me a <strong>BAC number</strong> that made me wait almost another hour before driving home. That was a wake-up call. At my age, I don’t want to risk my license, my wife’s safety, or someone else’s life just because I “felt fine.” I keep it in my glove box now.</p>",
            "post_image": "shopify://shop_images/1_de2a2eeb-7e58-45a9-ac85-6c68d03b80ff.png",
            "post_reactions": "like, love, care",
            "post_reactions_text": "2.3k",
            "post_comments_text": "65 Comments",
            "comment_1_author": "Comment author",
            "comment_1_author_verified": false,
            "comment_1_time": "2h ago",
            "comment_1_text": "",
            "comment_2_author": "Comment author",
