          }
        },
        "column_weKzrp": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "post_author": "Linda C.",
            "post_author_avatar": "shopify://shop_images/841d6f45-399e-4137-9b8b-9d3a9b7e4dcf.png",
            "post_author_verified": false,
            "post_time": "10h ago",
            "post_text": "<p>My son is 21 and just started going out more with friends from college. He’s a good kid, but good kids still make bad decisions when they feel confident after a few drinks. I bought <strong>HOSFU</strong> for him before he moved back to campus. He laughed at first, but two weeks later he texted me a photo of the screen and said he took an Uber instead of driving. That one text made the purchase worth it. I can’t be with him every night, but at least he has one extra check before he starts the car.</p>",
            "post_image": "shopify://shop_images/2_e3d0a8d8-d7f4-4460-be79-453534b1014e.png",
            "post_reactions": "like, love, care",
