    "collapsible_content_nJrYmE": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "faq_1": {
          "type": "collapsible-row-content",
          "settings": {
            "open": false,
            "heading": "How is this different from cheaper breathalyzers on the market?",
            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>The core difference lies in the <strong>Fuel Cell Sensor</strong>—the exact same technology used by police officers on the side of the road. While cheaper models use semiconductor sensors that can be easily tricked by food or smoke, SoberSense combines a dual-core processor and the latest AI algorithm to deliver extreme accuracy, within <strong>±0.005</strong> of professional law enforcement devices.</p>",
            "page": ""
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "faq_2": {
          "type": "collapsible-row-content",
          "settings": {
            "open": false,
            "heading": "Can this replace an official police breathalyzer?",
            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>No. While this breathalyzer delivers professional-grade accuracy and shares the same sensor technology as police units, it is strictly designed as a personal safety device. It shows your exact BAC on a live digital display so you can make an informed, responsible decision, but it does not replace official law enforcement results.</p>",
            "page": ""
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "faq_3": {
          "type": "collapsible-row-content",
          "settings": {
            "open": false,
            "heading": "Who is this device designed for?",
            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>This product is for anyone who values safety, responsibility, and peace of mind. It’s an essential tool for daily drivers, social drinkers, or anyone who wants to accurately check for overnight alcohol in their system the morning after a few drinks before getting behind the wheel.</p>",
            "page": ""
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "faq_4": {
          "type": "collapsible-row-content",
          "settings": {
            "open": false,
            "heading": "How should I use it to get the most accurate reading?",
            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>For the most accurate blood alcohol content (BAC) reading, you should wait at least 15 to 20 minutes after your last drink or meal before testing. Once you blow into the device, the system analyzes your breath instantly and gives you a precise reading in just <strong>5 seconds</strong>.</p>",
            "page": ""
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "faq_5": {
          "type": "collapsible-row-content",
          "settings": {
            "open": false,
            "heading": "Is it hygienic to share with friends or family?",
            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Absolutely. The device features a detachable air intake nozzle made from food-grade PP material. This makes it incredibly easy to clean, store, and safely share with friends or family members for quick cross-checks without compromising personal hygiene.</p>",
            "page": ""
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "faq_6": {
          "type": "collapsible-row-content",
          "settings": {
            "open": false,
            "heading": "Is the design discreet and portable?",
            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Yes. This breathalyzer is built with a sleek, minimalist, and ultra-compact design (the main body is just 101mm x 38mm). It easily fits right into your pocket, a small bag, or your car's center console without taking up much space, allowing for discreet storage and use wherever you go.</p>",
            "page": ""
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "faq_7": {
          "type": "collapsible-row-content",
          "settings": {
            "open": false,
            "heading": "What if it doesn't feel like the right fit for me?",
            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Your purchase is completely risk-free. We are extremely confident in the reliability of our device, which is why we proudly offer a <strong>30-Day Money-Back Guarantee</strong>. If you try the product and feel it doesn't give you the peace of mind you expected, simply return it within 100 days for a full refund. No questions asked.</p>",
            "page": ""
          },
          "blocks": {}
        }
      },
